 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Progress `total` can now be `None`, rendering a pulse bar when the total is unknown https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/1054
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fall back to `sys.__stderr__` on POSIX systems when trying to get the terminal size (fix issues when Rich is piped to another process)
